That question is actually difficult to answer if you're not the Dev
Team, which is why I don't really seriously try to do so.  I prefer to
focus on "What problems are caused by Elbereth?" as something that's a
lot more easy to concretely identify; ie. you can postulate situations,
etc.

I'm sure there's no end of speculation as to exactly why, but barring
quotes from the Dev Team themselves, it's basically just speculation.

> I see this as being sort of like the elementals on their home plane
